openi2pd OpenBSD port template
==============================

This directory is a template for the external OpenBSD `net/i2pd` ports
tree. It is not installed by CMake and is not built by this repository's CI.

Merge the files into the ports tree rather than copying them blindly:

  * `Makefile` selects CMake/Ninja, the native TUI and the packaged paths.
  * `PLIST` records `_i2pd`, `@rcscript`, `@sample` configuration and the
    read-only certificate tree.
  * `pkg/README` documents resource limits, syslog, graceful shutdown and the
    TUI socket. `pkg/DESCR` is intentionally not duplicated here.

The rc.d and login-class sources remain `../i2pd.rc` and `../i2pd.login`; the
port's `SUBST_VARS` must substitute `TRUEPREFIX`, `SYSCONFDIR` and
`LOCALSTATEDIR` before installing the rendered files. The installed file is
therefore not byte-identical to the template.

No port build, `pkg_create`, `pkg_add`, `rcctl` or OpenBSD runtime validation
has been performed by this repository.
